WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:07.400
Some products, product categories and products from brands enrolled in Amazon

00:00:07.400 --> 00:00:12.047
brand registry require approval before you can list them.

00:00:12.047 --> 00:00:13.080
Applications help

00:00:13.080 --> 00:00:18.062
customers shop with confidence knowing products are safe and authentic.

00:00:18.062 --> 00:00:18.560
The

00:00:18.560 --> 00:00:22.520
application will occur during the listing process and will look slightly

00:00:22.520 --> 00:00:26.280
different depending on if you're selling a product that already exists in the

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:31.099
Amazon store or if you're selling a product that is new to Amazon.

00:00:31.099 --> 00:00:31.840
To start

00:00:31.840 --> 00:00:35.693
navigate to the add a product page in Seller Central.

00:00:35.693 --> 00:00:37.620
In the search tab search

00:00:37.620 --> 00:00:38.584
for your product.

00:00:38.584 --> 00:00:42.120
If your product is already being sold in the Amazon store

00:00:42.120 --> 00:00:44.863
click on your product from the search options.

00:00:44.863 --> 00:00:46.920
If approval is required to sell

00:00:46.920 --> 00:00:51.760
that product you'll see a message like you need approval to list this brand or

00:00:51.760 --> 00:00:54.442
you need approval to list these products.

00:00:54.442 --> 00:00:56.740
Select your product condition from the

00:00:56.740 --> 00:00:59.690
drop-down menu then click apply to sell.

00:00:59.690 --> 00:01:02.640
To list a new product first search to

00:01:02.640 --> 00:01:04.407
confirm there's no existing listing.

00:01:04.407 --> 00:01:06.880
If it doesn't appear in search results

00:01:06.880 --> 00:01:09.030
click create a new listing.

00:01:09.030 --> 00:01:12.040
You'll discover if your product requires category

00:01:12.040 --> 00:01:14.112
approval when you select a product type.

00:01:14.112 --> 00:01:16.480
Look for the learn more button with a

00:01:16.480 --> 00:01:17.211
lock icon.

00:01:17.211 --> 00:01:21.600
Click this button to open the help page categories and products that

00:01:21.600 --> 00:01:22.502
require approval.

00:01:22.502 --> 00:01:26.560
Find and click request approval next to the relevant

00:01:26.560 --> 00:01:26.937
category.

00:01:26.937 --> 00:01:31.080
You'll discover if you need brand approval while entering the brand

00:01:31.080 --> 00:01:31.489
name.

00:01:31.489 --> 00:01:36.391
Use the button in the message to access the selling application page.

00:01:36.391 --> 00:01:36.800
You'll

00:01:36.800 --> 00:01:41.200
have to submit a new application for each unique category or brand you want to

00:01:41.200 --> 00:01:41.529
sell.

00:01:41.529 --> 00:01:45.480
However once you have approval you will not have to resubmit an

00:01:45.480 --> 00:01:50.100
application when listing other products in that same category or brand.

00:01:50.100 --> 00:01:50.520
For

00:01:50.520 --> 00:01:54.800
category approval the process is the same for both new and existing products.

00:01:54.800 --> 00:01:59.760
You'll need to submit at least one purchase invoice from a manufacturer or

00:01:59.760 --> 00:02:00.324
distributor.

00:02:00.324 --> 00:02:05.960
Your invoice must meet these requirements dated within 180 days.

00:02:05.960 --> 00:02:09.822
Includes your name and address matching your selling account.

00:02:09.822 --> 00:02:10.680
Includes the

00:02:10.680 --> 00:02:14.760
manufacturer or distributor's name and address and shows a combined purchase of

00:02:14.760 --> 00:02:16.311
at least 400 units.

00:02:16.311 --> 00:02:19.800
Check each box to confirm your document meets the

00:02:19.800 --> 00:02:20.276
requirements.

00:02:20.276 --> 00:02:23.608
You can omit pricing information if needed.

00:02:23.608 --> 00:02:24.560
Upload your

00:02:24.560 --> 00:02:31.028
invoice as a PDF, doc, PNG, GIF or JPEG file, maximum 10 MB.

00:02:31.028 --> 00:02:32.520
Make sure it's

00:02:32.520 --> 00:02:35.804
high resolution and in the correct orientation.

00:02:35.804 --> 00:02:37.680
Provide your contact email

00:02:37.680 --> 00:02:41.640
and optional phone numbers so we can reach you with questions.

00:02:41.640 --> 00:02:42.360
Finally, click

00:02:42.360 --> 00:02:42.703
submit.

00:02:42.703 --> 00:02:47.160
When applying to sell a brand the process is different for new and

00:02:47.160 --> 00:02:47.913
existing products.

00:02:47.913 --> 00:02:51.680
For existing products select the document type you want to

00:02:51.680 --> 00:02:56.600
upload either a purchase invoice from a manufacturer or distributor or an

00:02:56.600 --> 00:02:58.473
authorization letter from the brand.

00:02:58.473 --> 00:03:00.720
Purchase invoices must meet the same

00:03:00.720 --> 00:03:02.896
requirements as category approvals.

00:03:02.896 --> 00:03:06.160
Authorization letters must be dated within

00:03:06.160 --> 00:03:06.947
180 days.

00:03:06.947 --> 00:03:10.880
On the brand's letterhead include your name and address matching

00:03:10.880 --> 00:03:14.513
your selling account and include the brand's name and address.

00:03:14.513 --> 00:03:15.240
After uploading

00:03:15.240 --> 00:03:20.600
your documents provide your contact information and any optional comments then

00:03:20.600 --> 00:03:21.369
click submit.

00:03:21.369 --> 00:03:25.600
Note that brand approval lets you match offers to existing product

00:03:25.600 --> 00:03:26.388
detail pages.

00:03:26.388 --> 00:03:30.720
It doesn't provide listing privileges to create or edit pages or

00:03:30.720 --> 00:03:35.234
access to brand benefits like stores and a plus content.

00:03:35.234 --> 00:03:37.040
Those are reserved for

00:03:37.040 --> 00:03:40.851
sellers internal to the brand and authorized resellers.

00:03:40.851 --> 00:03:42.280
For new products

00:03:42.280 --> 00:03:46.533
you'll need to get an authorization letter from the brand directly.

00:03:46.533 --> 00:03:46.920
You'll

00:03:46.920 --> 00:03:51.000
provide the authorization letter from the brand plus product information and

00:03:51.000 --> 00:03:54.714
images to create the new ASIN and product detail page.

00:03:54.714 --> 00:03:56.200
This is the only

00:03:56.200 --> 00:04:01.320
scenario where a seller other than the brand owner or authorized reseller can

00:04:01.320 --> 00:04:06.280
apply to create a new listing for a brand enrolled in Amazon brand registry.

00:04:06.280 --> 00:04:11.120
After submitting your application you'll receive confirmation within 24 hours

00:04:11.120 --> 00:04:13.229
that we're reviewing your request.

00:04:13.229 --> 00:04:15.760
Most reviews are completed within three

00:04:15.760 --> 00:04:16.747
business days.

00:04:16.747 --> 00:04:21.680
To check your application status go to view selling applications

00:04:21.680 --> 00:04:22.991
in Seller Central.

00:04:22.991 --> 00:04:27.360
Once approved click list products to start adding products to

00:04:27.360 --> 00:04:30.160
your inventory.
